---
// src/pages/privacy-policy.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for NSEinsider."
>
  <div class="container py-12 md:py-16 max-w-3xl animate-in-up">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-foreground mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-8">Effective date: March 11, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-blog">
      <p>
        NSEinsider ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect,
        how we use it, and your rights when you use <strong>nseinsider.co.ke</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact details you provide, such as your name, email address, and message content.</li>
        <li>Technical data such as browser type, device information, IP address, and pages visited.</li>
        <li>Interaction data, including page views, clicks, and referral sources for analytics.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the website and content quality.</li>
        <li>To respond to enquiries and support requests.</li>
        <li>To monitor performance, prevent abuse, and protect site security.</li>
        <li>To measure audience behavior and optimize content and user experience.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        We may use cookies and similar technologies for functionality, analytics, and performance measurement.
        You can control cookies through your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Advertising and Monetization</h2>
      <p>
        We may display advertising now or in the future, including third-party ad networks. These services may
        use cookies or similar technologies to deliver and measure ads. If enabled, ad providers may process
        limited technical and usage data according to their own privacy policies.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Analytics Providers</h2>
      <p>
        We may use analytics tools to understand site usage. These tools may collect technical information and
        interaction data in aggregate or pseudonymous form.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal data. We may share data with trusted service providers who help operate the
        site (hosting, analytics, email handling), subject to appropriate safeguards.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain personal data only as long as needed for the purposes described in this policy, legal
        obligations, dispute resolution, and security requirements.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Security</h2>
      <p>
        We apply reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect data. No online system can guarantee
        absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Subject to applicable law, you may request access, correction, deletion, or restriction of personal data
        we hold about you.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Children</h2>
      <p>
        This site is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from
        children.
      </p>

      <h2>11. International Access</h2>
      <p>
        By using this website, you understand your information may be processed in locations where our service
        providers operate.
      </p>

      <h2>12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected on this page with an
        updated effective date.
      </p>

      <h2>13. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions or requests, contact us at{" "}
        <a href="mailto:nseinsider@protonmail.com">nseinsider@protonmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
